NOTICE

StutterFix (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "StutterFix" by wisecase2
(https://github.com/wisecase2/StutterFix, MIT, 1.3M downloads on
Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.21).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
wisecase2. This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to
Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric) because the original has not been updated
to this version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
Port changes: the in-game options GUI was removed (configuration is
JSON-only, per this repo's no-GUI policy for simple ports), and the
main-worker-executor overwrite was dropped because
Util.getMainWorkerExecutor() was removed in 26.3 (replaced by
backgroundExecutor()). Render/server thread priority and remove-yield
behaviour are preserved.
